      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4137_Task5" name="Analytics build the network &amp; inventory performance dashboard: turns, inventory…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Analytics build the network &amp; inventory performance dashboard: turns, inventory investment, fill rate, OTIF, stockouts, aging, cost-to-serve, by SKU/location/echelon, vs target
Responsible (R): Analytics / Network Strategy Lead
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4137_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4137_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4137_Task6" name="Supply Chain leadership review weekly/monthly, identify exceptions/trends, and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Chain leadership review weekly/monthly, identify exceptions/trends, and trigger action or re-optimization (W4142)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Network Strategy Lead
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Weekly/Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4137_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4137_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4137_Task7" name="Analytics tune the dashboard, ensure data quality (links to VS-28.2), and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Analytics tune the dashboard, ensure data quality (links to VS-28.2), and evolve metrics with maturity
Responsible (R): Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4137_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4137_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4137_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
