        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-80 (ensure inventory parameter &amp; network optimization governance.) | - CTL-640: KPI definitions governed; data-quality monitored
Owner: Supply Chain Analytics (VS-28) / Network Strategy Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
