    <bpmn:process id="W_W4138" name="W4138. Inventory Health, Aging &amp; Stock-Out Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; aging threshold; stockout event
Frequency: Continuous + monthly review
Volume: 35,000 SKUs across 205 locations
Owner: Supply Planning / Inventory Lifecycle (VS-05)
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02), Inventory Lifecycle (VS-05), Merchandising (VS-01), Analytics (VS-28)
Source: workflow W4138 — Inventory Health, Aging &amp; Stock-Out Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4138_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4138_Lane1" name="Supply Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4138_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4138_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4138_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4138_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4138_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4138_Start3" name="Continuous; aging threshold; stockout event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4138_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4138_Task4" name="Supply Planning/Analytics monitor inventory health: aging buckets, dead/slow…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Planning/Analytics monitor inventory health: aging buckets, dead/slow stock (links to W4134), over-stock, stockouts/OOS, and accuracy (≥97% target links to VS-05)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4138_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4138_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4138_Task5" name="Supply Planning/Merchandising action on signals: expedite/rebalance on stockout…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planning/Merchandising action on signals: expedite/rebalance on stockout (links to VS-05 transfers), clear/centralize on over-stock/aging (links to W4134/VS-64)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per signal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4138_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4138_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4138_Task6" name="Supply Planning report inventory health trends, root-cause recurring issues…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply Planning report inventory health trends, root-cause recurring issues, and feed into re-optimization (W4142) and assortment (VS-01)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4138_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4138_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4138_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4138_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-640 (ensure controlled execution — Network &amp; Inventory Performance Analytics, Simulation &amp; Continuous Re-Optimization (PA-136.3).) | - CTL-640: inventory-accuracy ≥97% target (VS-05); aging thresholds
Owner: Supply Planning / Inventory Lifecycle (VS-05)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
