    <bpmn:process id="W_W4139" name="W4139. Fill Rate, Service Level &amp; OTIF Performance Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Continuous; service-review
Frequency: Continuous + monthly
Volume: All replenishment (~5,000 orders/mo), ecommerce (~42,900/mo), DC outbound
Owner: Supply Planning / Logistics (VS-06)
Participants: Supply Planning (VS-02), Logistics (VS-06), DC Ops (VS-04), CX (VS-13)
Source: workflow W4139 — Fill Rate, Service Level &amp; OTIF Performance Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4139_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4139_Lane1" name="Supply Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4139_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4139_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4139_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4139_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4139_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4139_Start3" name="Continuous; service-review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4139_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4139_Task4" name="Supply Planning/Logistics measure fill rate, line/item fill rate, service-level…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Supply Planning/Logistics measure fill rate, line/item fill rate, service-level attainment vs target (W4131), and OTIF (on-time-in-full) for DC-to-store and ecommerce (links to VS-02/VS-06/VS-10)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Logistics / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4139_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4139_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4139_Task5" name="Supply Planning/Logistics root-cause misses (forecast error, supply delay…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Supply Planning/Logistics root-cause misses (forecast error, supply delay, picking error, routing), and act (expedite, parameter adjust W4131, lane change W4126)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / Logistics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Per signal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4139_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4139_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4139_Task6" name="Supply Planning report service performance, link to CX/complaints (VS-13) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Supply Planning report service performance, link to CX/complaints (VS-13) and lost-sale estimation, and feed into re-optimization (W4142)
Responsible (R): Supply Planning / CX / Analytics
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4139_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4139_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4139_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
