        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-640 (ensure controlled execution — Network &amp; Inventory Performance Analytics, Simulation &amp; Continuous Re-Optimization (PA-136.3).) | - CTL-640: service-level targets per segment (W4131/W4132); OTIF SLA
Owner: Supply Planning / Logistics (VS-06)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
