    <bpmn:process id="W_W4140" name="W4140. Network Cost-to-Serve &amp; Total Landed Cost Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Cost review; network decision
Frequency: Quarterly + per decision
Volume: Enterprise network cost (inbound, DC, outbound, last-mile, inventory carrying)
Owner: Network Strategy Lead / Finance (VS-110)
Participants: Finance (VS-17.4/VS-110), Freight (VS-110), Logistics (VS-06), DC Ops (VS-04)
Source: workflow W4140 — Network Cost-to-Serve &amp; Total Landed Cost Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4140_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4140_Lane1" name="Network Strategy Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4140_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4140_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4140_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4140_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4140_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4140_Start3" name="Cost review; network decision">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4140_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4140_Task4" name="Network Strategy/Finance compute cost-to-serve per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Network Strategy/Finance compute cost-to-serve per SKU/location/customer/channel (inbound freight, duty, DC handling, outbound, last-mile, inventory carrying), and total landed cost (links to VS-110 freight audit and W2B import landed cost)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance / Freight
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4140_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4140_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4140_Task5" name="Network Strategy identify cost outliers and improvement opportunities (lane…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Network Strategy identify cost outliers and improvement opportunities (lane W4125/W4126, inventory W4136, DC W4123), and quantify impact via modeling (W4122)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4140_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4140_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4140_Task6" name="Network Strategy report cost-to-serve trends, drive cost-out (links to VS-133…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Network Strategy report cost-to-serve trends, drive cost-out (links to VS-133 W4068), and feed into pricing/margin decisions (VS-01.2/VS-101)
Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / Finance / Merchandising
Accountable (A): COO / CFO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4140_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4140_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4140_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
