Responsible (R): Network Strategy Lead / MDM
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4142_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4142_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
